<% content_for :title, "Privacy · 535" %>

<article class="max-w-2xl space-y-7 text-slate-700">
  <div>
    <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl font-semibold text-slate-900">Privacy, briefly</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-500">Effective August 19, 2026</p>
  </div>

  <p>
    535 is a small project operated by Appmakey LLC. We collect only what we need to run the site: the email address you provide for dispatch updates, ordinary server and security logs, and basic usage information from third-party analytics.
  </p>

  <section>
    <h2 class="font-serif text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900">What we do with it</h2>
    <p class="mt-2">
      We use your email address to send the dispatches you requested and to operate unsubscribe and delivery-suppression controls. We use logs and analytics to keep the site working and understand, in broad strokes, how people use it. We do not sell the personal information you provide to anyone.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="font-serif text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900">Who helps run the site</h2>
    <p class="mt-2">
      DigitalOcean hosts the application, Cloudflare provides DNS and related network services, and Resend delivers email. Those providers process limited information on our behalf under their own terms. If we add or change analytics providers, this page will describe the service actually in use.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2 class="font-serif text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900">Your choices</h2>
    <p class="mt-2">
      Every dispatch includes an unsubscribe link, and you can also use the
      <%= link_to "email preferences page", email_preferences_path, class: "font-medium text-amber-700 hover:text-amber-800" %>.
      We retain subscription and delivery-suppression records as needed to honor those choices. To ask us to delete or correct information, email
      <%= mail_to "cmartyn@gmail.com", "cmartyn@gmail.com", class: "font-medium text-amber-700 hover:text-amber-800" %>.
    </p>
  </section>

  <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">Appmakey LLC · 5305 Macomb St NW, Washington, DC 20016</p>
</article>
